    routePath: 'call-bridge',
    LLM: 'Game: Call Bridge. 52-card. 4 players individual. Spades always trump. Bid 1-8 tricks. Must follow suit; if void must play spade if held. Score: met bid = bid + 0.1Ã—overs; fail = -bid. 5 rounds.',
    Player: 'You hold: Aâ™ , Kâ™ , Qâ™£, Jâ™¦, 10â™¥, 9â™¥, 8â™ , 7â™ , 6â™¦, 5â™£, 4â™ , 3â™¥, 2â™¦. Count your tricks: Aâ™  (certain), Kâ™  (very likely), 8â™ +7â™ +4â™  might win if opponents are out of spades. Bid 3 safely. With luck, score 3+.',
    tagline: 'Bid your tricks. Win at least that many. Score or suffer.',
